---
source: src/ui/tests/menus.rs
expression: items(&app)
---
EDITOR
Copy  [Ctrl+C]
Cut  [Ctrl+X]  (dimmed)
Paste  [Ctrl+V]
---
Run (the selection, or everything)  [F5]
Run the statement at the cursor  [F6]
Explain (plan only)  [F7]
Explain analyze (runs it)  [Shift+F7]
Explain in plain words (AI)  [Ctrl+K y y]
---
Commit the open transaction  [F8]  (dimmed)
Roll back the open transaction  [Shift+F8]  (dimmed)
Transaction mode…  [Ctrl+K x]
---
Select the statement  [Ctrl+K v]
Zoom the statement (alone)  [Ctrl+K b]
Format SQL  [Ctrl+K f]
Comment / uncomment lines  [Ctrl+K -]
Find and replace  [Ctrl+F]
Go to the next lint warning  [Ctrl+K w]
---
Insert a snippet or saved query  [Ctrl+K i]
Save the statement to the library  []
Save the tab to the library  [Ctrl+S]
Search saved queries and history  [Ctrl+K l]
---
Zoom this pane (and back)  [Ctrl+K z]
All commands…  [Ctrl+K /]
---
Close the tab  [Ctrl+W]
